QEF Election Invalid - No Annual Information Statement.
QEF election requires PFIC to provide annual information statement with ordinary earnings and net capital gain. Without this statement, QEF election is invalid and shareholder defaults to excess distribution regime.
Shareholders should request PFIC Annual Information Statement from fund management or consider mark-to-market election if stock is marketable.
Reference: IRC § 1295(b), Treas. Reg. § 1.1295-1(g)
