Calculate NOL deduction and carryforward. Applies 80% limitation and tracks NOL for future years.
result.nol_carryforward_from_prior_years > 0 Has NOL carryforward from prior years
result.taxable_income > 0 Has positive taxable income before NOL
result.taxable_income < 0 Has negative taxable income (current year NOL)
Y Y
// ======================================== // NOL Deduction with 80% Limitation // ========================================
// Save taxable income before NOL deduction result.taxable_income_before_nol = result.taxable_income;
// Calculate 80% limitation (IRC 172(a)(2)) // NOL deduction cannot exceed 80% of taxable income before NOL result.nol_80pct_limitation = result.taxable_income_before_nol * 0.80;
// NOL deduction is lesser of: // 1. NOL carryforward from prior years // 2. 80% of taxable income before NOL result.nol_deduction_allowed = Math.min( result.nol_carryforward_from_prior_years, result.nol_80pct_limitation );
// Apply NOL deduction result.taxable_income_after_nol = result.taxable_income_before_nol - result.nol_deduction_allowed;
// Update taxable income (replaces original calculation) result.taxable_income = result.taxable_income_after_nol;
// Calculate remaining NOL carryforward result.nol_carryforward_to_future_years = result.nol_carryforward_from_prior_years - result.nol_deduction_allowed;
// No current year NOL (profitable year) result.nol_current_year = 0.0;
NOL deduction applied to positive taxable income.
**Post-TCJA Rules (2018+)**: - NOL deduction limited to 80% of taxable income before NOL - Cannot reduce taxable income below 20% of pre-NOL amount - Unused NOL carries forward indefinitely
**Example**: - Taxable income before NOL: $1,000,000 - 80% limitation: $800,000 - Prior NOL carryforward: $1,500,000 - NOL deduction allowed: $800,000 (limited by 80%) - Taxable income after NOL: $200,000 - Remaining NOL carryforward: $700,000
**CARES Act Exceptions**: - Tax years 2018-2020: 80% limitation suspended - Farming losses: Different rules (not implemented)
Reference: IRC § 172(a)(2) - 80% limitation Reference: TCJA § 13302 - NOL amendments
