General Category Income (IRC § 904(d)(1)(A)): - Active business income - Manufacturing, services, sales - Most CFC operating income
Passive Category Income (IRC § 904(d)(1)(A)): - Dividends, interest, royalties, rents - Capital gains - Foreign personal holding company income (FPHCI)
Impact on E&P Calculation: Foreign income taxes REDUCE earnings and profits (E&P). E&P = Net income per books - Foreign taxes paid + Other adjustments
Impact on Foreign Tax Credit: Foreign taxes paid by CFC can be "deemed paid" by U.S. shareholder when CFC makes distributions or when Subpart F income is included.
