Subpart F Income Components (IRC § 952(a))
Subpart F income includes: 1. Foreign Base Company Income (IRC § 954) 2. Insurance income (IRC § 953) 3. International boycott income (IRC § 952(a)(3)) 4. Illegal bribes, kickbacks, payments (IRC § 952(a)(4)) 5. Income from countries not recognized by U.S. (IRC § 952(a)(5))
This implementation includes FBCI and insurance income. Other categories are rare and not implemented.
