// De minimis rule: Subpart F income is ZERO form_5471.subpart_f_income = 0.0; form_5471.subpart_f_de_minimis_applied = true; form_5471.subpart_f_full_inclusion_applied = false; form_5471.subpart_f_after_ep_limitation = 0.0;
De Minimis Rule (IRC § 954(b)(3)(A))
If Subpart F income before limitations is less than the LESSER of: - $1,000,000, OR - 5% of gross income
Then Subpart F income is treated as ZERO (no inclusion).
Purpose: Provide administrative relief for CFCs with minimal passive income.
Note: De minimis rule does NOT apply if full inclusion rule applies.
Reference: IRC § 954(b)(3)(A) Reference: Form 5471 Instructions
