CFC has no tested income (either loss or zero income). QBAI deduction is only relevant when there is tested income to reduce.
Note: QBAI can still be tracked for informational purposes, but it does not affect GILTI calculation when there's no tested income.
Reference: IRC § 951A(b)(2)
