// Include in general basket instead result.ftc_general_foreign_income += foreign_branch.usd_net_income; result.ftc_general_foreign_taxes += foreign_branch.usd_foreign_taxes_paid;
Foreign branch that does not qualify as QBU: - Income included in general basket (not separate foreign branch basket) - Simpler FTC calculation - No IRC § 987 translation complexity
Reference: IRC § 904(d)(1)(A) (general basket)
