// ======================================== // Section 987 Unrealized Gain/Loss // ========================================
// Step 1: Calculate QBU net assets at different rates
// Net assets at historical exchange rates (cost basis) foreign_branch.net_assets_usd_at_historical_rates = foreign_branch.net_assets_fc_beginning * foreign_branch.spot_rate_beginning;
// Net assets at current spot rate (fair value) foreign_branch.net_assets_usd_at_current_rates = foreign_branch.net_assets_fc_ending * foreign_branch.spot_rate_ending;
// Step 2: Calculate unrealized § 987 gain/loss // Positive = gain (foreign currency strengthened) // Negative = loss (foreign currency weakened) foreign_branch.section_987_unrealized_gain_loss = foreign_branch.net_assets_usd_at_current_rates - foreign_branch.net_assets_usd_at_historical_rates;
// Step 3: Add to cumulative deferred gain/loss pool foreign_branch.section_987_cumulative_deferred_gain_loss += foreign_branch.section_987_unrealized_gain_loss;
// Step 4: No current recognition - deferred until remittance foreign_branch.section_987_realized_gain_loss = 0.0;
**Section 987 Unrealized Translation Gain/Loss**
When QBU functional currency exchange rate changes, translation gain/loss arises from revaluing QBU net assets at new spot rate.
**Calculation**: 1. QBU net assets at beginning of year (at historical rate) 2. QBU net assets at end of year (at current spot rate) 3. Difference = unrealized § 987 gain/loss
**Deferral Rule**: Unrealized § 987 gain/loss is NOT recognized currently. It accumulates in deferred gain/loss pool until: - Remittance from QBU to owner (proportional recognition) - QBU termination (full recognition)
**Example**: - QBU net assets: €1,000,000 - Beginning rate: 1 EUR = 1.10 USD → $1,100,000 - Ending rate: 1 EUR = 1.20 USD → $1,200,000 - Unrealized § 987 gain: $100,000 (deferred)
**Policy Rationale**: Deferral prevents recognition of paper gains/losses that may reverse. Remittance indicates permanent realization of currency exposure.
Reference: IRC § 987(3) Reference: Treas. Reg. § 1.987-4
